        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "When the oil is hot, working in batches and not overcrowding the pan, fry the dough discs, turning once or as required until golden brown, puffed and fully cooked, about 2 minutes per side. If browning too quickly and is still not fully cooked, cook on low. Continuously pour oil on dumplings to help it to cook more quickly."
