        "text": "Cover, reduce heat to low and steam until the eggplant and potatoes are tender, checking and stirring every 5 minutes to ensure that it does not stick. Any liquid accumulated on the cover should drain back into the pot. It takes about 20-30 minutes. You can leave it chunky or stir often to create a more cohesive, pasty result."
