    "description": "This Easy Spicy Chow Mein Recipe for Two is a quick, customizable meal that’s perfect for lunch or a busy weeknight dinner. Made with chewy chow mein noodles, your favorite protein, fresh vegetables, and a simple savory sauce, it’s ready in about 20 minutes and can easily be adapted to suit your taste or whatever ingredients you have on hand.",
