        "text": "Peel, rinse, quarter and place potatoes in a medium pot, cover with water and add 1 tbs salt and garlic. Bring to a boil, lower heat to medium high and cook until fork glides easily through the potato. If undercooked there will be lumps in the mashed potato so it is important to get this right. Drain."
