        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Cut wings in half separating the wingette from the wing. Remove any feathers. Wash chicken wings with the juice of one lemon, lime or vinegar and water. Remove slime, excess skin and fat. Wash a second time with plain water. Drain well."
