        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "In a large pot over medium heat, add oil. When hot but not smoking add sugar and allow it to bubble, froth and darken. Do not allow it to smoke and get black. If this happens you have to start over! Add ketchup and cook 15 seconds more while stirring."
