        "text": "Pinch off pieces of the rested dough and shape into small ovals, discs, or any desired shape. Alternatively, form the dough into a large ball, lightly flour your work surface, and roll it out into a 1/4-inch-thick round. Using a sharp knife, cut vertically and then horizontally about 1½ inches apart to form small squares."
