        "text": "In a large pot, bring water, coconut milk, green seasoning, and salt to a boil. Gently add the shaped dumplings to the pot. Do not stir for the first 2 minutes to prevent breaking or mashing. Let them cook for 10–15 minutes, or until the dumplings float and are no longer raw in the center. You can strain the dumplings and set aside, or leave them in the cooking liquid until ready to serve."
