      "1-3 sweet potatoes, peeled and quartered (about 2 pounds)",
      "2 green bananas, figs, peeled and quartered",
      "1 medium carrot, sliced",
      "8 ochroes, tops removed",
      "3 small eddoes, yautia, peeled (about 1 pound)",
