        "text": "Add seasoned shrimp, stir well to combine and cook for 10 – 15 minutes. Stir occasionally to ensure that it does not stick. The shrimp will release its own juices and cook in those juices, however, if all the liquid evaporates add water as required. Taste and add more salt if required."
