      "3 cloves garlic, mashed or thinly sliced",
      "hot pepper, Scotch bonnet, habanero, wiri wiri or any hot pepper available, to taste",
      "1/2 small onion, thinly sliced",
      "3 to 4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, or other oil, to taste",
